    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2NkrtdVQB7ta1ft5gbxAUVr)_\n\nBefore: `* Open pull requests` held 32 entries, 30 of them already merged, in no clear order; every entry ended with its PR link.\n\nAfter:\n- Every bullet in the file starts with its PR link and author, then the text (`[#N] (Claude) Added ...`). The intro line says so.\n- The merged PRs left `Open pull requests`: the dashboard, start-up and module-docs ones joined their existing sets, and five new sets (mode line, mini-frame, themes, note tags, BibTeX) were added, each with its merge-date range (UTC), ordered by dependency then number.\n- `Open pull requests` now lists only the open #79 and #125 (#125 was missing).\n- Wrong numbers fixed: sp themes #97 (was #103), sp-env #101 (was #102), sp-fetch-academic #92 and #118 (was #119).\n\nThe file has no per-date headings since it was regrouped by feature, so \"merge dates\" are the date range under each set title.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01XHLFVQytr7NYz1hjyos2a1",
